{"narration": "¿Sabes qué mira un mecánico en los primeros diez segundos que llegas al taller? No es el motor. Primero, la cadena: si cuelga mucho, ya te está robando fuerza. Segundo, las llantas: un borde gastado delata cómo frenas. Tercero, el humo del escape: si sale azul, está quemando aceite. Y lo último… cómo suena en mínimo. ¿Tu moto pasaría la prueba? Escríbenos y la revisamos.", "words": [["¿Sabes", 0.1, 0.388], ["qué", 0.388, 0.588], ["mira", 0.588, 0.832], ["un", 0.832, 0.989], ["mecánico", 0.989, 1.408], ["en", 1.408, 1.565], ["los", 1.565, 1.765], ["primeros", 1.765, 2.184], ["diez", 2.184, 2.428], ["segundos", 2.428, 2.846], ["que", 2.846, 3.047], ["llegas", 3.047, 3.378], ["al", 3.378, 3.535], ["taller?", 3.535, 3.866], ["No", 4.725, 4.952], ["es", 4.952, 5.179], ["el", 5.179, 5.406], ["motor.", 5.406, 5.822], ["Primero,", 6.791, 7.156], ["la", 7.25, 7.403], ["cadena:", 7.403, 7.726], ["si", 7.896, 8.049], ["cuelga", 8.049, 8.372], ["mucho,", 8.372, 8.653], ["ya", 8.746, 8.899], ["te", 8.899, 9.053], ["está", 9.053, 9.291], ["robando", 9.291, 9.656], ["fuerza.", 9.656, 9.979], ["Segundo,", 10.795, 11.185], ["las", 11.285, 11.493], ["llantas:", 11.493, 11.883], ["un", 12.064, 12.227], ["borde", 12.227, 12.527], ["gastado", 12.527, 12.916], ["delata", 12.916, 13.261], ["cómo", 13.261, 13.514], ["frenas.", 13.514, 13.859], ["Tercero,", 14.67, 15.036], ["el", 15.13, 15.283], ["humo", 15.283, 15.522], ["del", 15.522, 15.718], ["escape:", 15.718, 16.042], ["si", 16.212, 16.366], ["sale", 16.366, 16.604], ["azul,", 16.604, 16.843], ["está", 16.937, 17.175], ["quemando", 17.175, 17.585], ["aceite.", 17.585, 17.908], ["Y", 18.524, 18.679], ["lo", 18.679, 18.893], ["último…", 18.893, 19.346], ["cómo", 20.122, 20.454], ["suena", 20.454, 20.846], ["en", 20.846, 21.06], ["mínimo.", 21.06, 21.511], ["¿Tu", 22.188, 22.391], ["moto", 22.391, 22.708], ["pasaría", 22.708, 23.194], ["la", 23.194, 23.398], ["prueba?", 23.398, 23.828], ["Escríbenos", 24.863, 25.494], ["y"